<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dial Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dial Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised Dial Corp's logn-term rating to buy from accumulate.  Merrill said it kept Dial's near-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
